{"id":1815473,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-03T18:49:15.327Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/phl9KHPVnre6paAvhmSv4Ku9pMD.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cv1efKFBCBU","id":1815473,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"THE MASCOT","overview":"In the late 70s, Paul Woelbing asked his dad if there'd ever be a job for him at the family company. His dad said, \"No, I don't think so. What would you do?\"  So Paul went to the East Coast and taught school. Then he came home.  Today he co-owns Carma Laboratories, the company behind Carmex, with his brother Eric. Their grandfather invented it during the Depression after losing his job. He picked a name that means nothing and a color that stood out on the shelf. Then he drove the Midwest, giving pharmacies a free dozen with a stamped reorder card. If it doesn't sell, throw it out. If it does, here's the card.  That's how it was built. This is how it's been carried: 100% family-owned, no outside investors, by design. One of America's top places to work seven years running. And a co-owner who calls himself the mascot.","popularity":0.2135,"poster_path":"/sSlQmH4LEWymyemjZwnFhdvRuNY.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":316727,"logo_path":null,"name":"Rowan","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-10-01","revenue":0,"runtime":8,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"THE MASCOT","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6595560,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Paul Woelbing","original_name":"Paul Woelbing","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":1,"character":"","credit_id":"6ae9000f087fd773c9c32d96","order":0}],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":6035103,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"Julia Doogan","origin